{"unit_id":"xfgil__dsh-session-clock#card-zh","repo":"xfgil/dsh-session-clock","commit":"7d22e0cf49945fdc360508b31962938800f67c6d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-clock 是 DeepSeek Harness 插件，面向 DSH 主机的会话时间上下文。它监听会话事件，并在 agent 预步骤中按配置注入时钟信息；默认只补充用户上次主动发言间隔和其他会话最近活动时间。它还提供跨重启保存的会话状态、session_clock 查询工具，以及状态查看、会话列表和开关等 HTTP 接口。可按会话通配符或正则筛选，并可选择补充、追加或完整时间上下文模式。适合需要区分会话空闲时间或主动查询会话时钟的 DSH 用户；状态保存在本机 JSON 文件，可用 DSH_HOME 或 stateFile 指定位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:98-110","lib/index.js:391-479","lib/index.js:724-825","lib/store.js:24-28"]}
{"unit_id":"xfgil__dsh-session-clock#card-en","repo":"xfgil/dsh-session-clock","commit":"7d22e0cf49945fdc360508b31962938800f67c6d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-clock adds per-session time context to DeepSeek Harness. It tracks activity and injects user idle time and cross-session activity before agent steps. It persists state, provides a session_clock tool and HTTP controls, and supports session patterns and supplement, append, or full mode.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:98-110","lib/index.js:391-479","lib/index.js:724-825","lib/store.js:24-28"]}
