{"unit_id":"xfgil__dsh-session-clock#feature-per-session-injection","repo":"xfgil/dsh-session-clock","commit":"7d22e0cf49945fdc360508b31962938800f67c6d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-clock 的功能「按会话注入时钟」：在 agent 预步骤读取会话并按白名单、黑名单及跳过子代理等配置决定是否注入。默认补充用户上次发言间隔和跨会话活动信息，也支持追加或完整模式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:391-479"]}
{"unit_id":"xfgil__dsh-session-clock#feature-persistent-state","repo":"xfgil/dsh-session-clock","commit":"7d22e0cf49945fdc360508b31962938800f67c6d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-clock 的功能「持久化会话活动」：追踪会话事件并把用户发言、活动时间和轮次等状态写入 JSON 文件。延迟合并写入并通过临时文件替换，重启后可恢复记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:320-350","lib/store.js:24-28","lib/store.js:75-100"]}
