{"unit_id":"xfgil__dsh-session-clock#feature-http-status","repo":"xfgil/dsh-session-clock","commit":"7d22e0cf49945fdc360508b31962938800f67c6d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-clock 的功能「HTTP 状态观测」：宿主提供 webServer 时，可查看插件状态、会话列表和日志，并通过接口切换启用状态、立即写盘或忘记某个会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:602-658"]}
